      "content": "that makes sense. the \"landside access\" thing is a good tip. i'm mostly just worried about these weird, sudden rule changes or little things the immigration officers might look for that aren't clearly listed on the main websites. like, is there any specific way they handle groups or certain types of employee documentation that could cause trouble at the gate? i just want to make sure there aren't any \"hidden\" traps that could result in the team being detained or turned away.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
